{"id":"n62094-1-7","stage":1,"title":"쌀 · 米","scene":"餐饮与生活","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n62094-1-7-1","ko":"엄마, 배고파요. 밥 좀 주세요.","zh":"妈妈，我饿了。请给我一些饭吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"엄마,","meaning":"妈妈","explanation":"엄마：妈妈","readings":[{"term":"엄마","audio":"/audio/9498f9014908e2891f1f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67098","senseId":"1","lemma":"엄마","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"배고파요.","meaning":"肚子饿","explanation":"배고프다：肚子饿；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"배고프다","audio":"/audio/8186b5026911737aa1b6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29316","senseId":"1","lemma":"배고프다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"밥","meaning":"饭","explanation":"밥：饭","readings":[{"term":"밥","audio":"/audio/828fa1e7e354b408527f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62683","senseId":"1","lemma":"밥","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"좀","meaning":"一下","explanation":"좀：一下","readings":[{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75798","senseId":"3","lemma":"좀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"주세요.","meaning":"给予，给","explanation":"주다：给予，给；세요：包含尊敬形式的礼貌句末，可表示请求、劝告或询问等。","readings":[{"term":"주다","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"82136","senseId":"1","lemma":"주다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"9498f9014908e289","term":"엄마","zh":"妈妈","audio":"/audio/9498f9014908e2891f1f.mp3","entryId":"67098","definition":"在非正式场合用于指称或称呼母亲。","pronunciation":["엄마"]},{"id":"8186b5026911737a","term":"배고프다","zh":"肚子饿","audio":"/audio/8186b5026911737aa1b6.mp3","entryId":"29316","definition":"感到肚子空了，想吃东西。","pronunciation":["배고프다"]},{"id":"828fa1e7e354b408","term":"밥","zh":"饭","audio":"/audio/828fa1e7e354b408527f.mp3","entryId":"62683","definition":"在大米或其他谷物中倒入水后煮干至熟的食物。","pronunciation":["밥"]},{"id":"70ae9bc35b2d378b","term":"좀","zh":"一下","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3","entryId":"75798","definition":"主要用于委婉请求或征得同意。","pronunciation":["좀"]},{"id":"1b43f195318e9604","term":"주다","zh":"给予，给","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3","entryId":"82136","definition":"把东西等递给别人，让别人拥有或使用。","pronunciation":["주다"]}],"audio":"/audio/5e9d3fb0e1af28f87179.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n62094-1-7-2","ko":"그래, 지금 쌀 씻고 있으니까 조금만 기다려.","zh":"好的，我正在洗米，你稍等一会儿。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그래,","meaning":"好吧，是","explanation":"그래：好吧，是","readings":[{"term":"그래","audio":"/audio/d39087dda3899d88b99b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27656","senseId":"1","lemma":"그래","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"지금","meaning":"现在","explanation":"지금：现在","readings":[{"term":"지금","audio":"/audio/df159f47a890ff655039.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62522","senseId":"1","lemma":"지금","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"쌀","meaning":"米，大米","explanation":"쌀：米，大米","readings":[{"term":"쌀","audio":"/audio/409668b14ff6c36e6073.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62094","senseId":"1","lemma":"쌀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"씻고","meaning":"洗，刷","explanation":"씻다：洗，刷；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"씻다","audio":"/audio/1fc19ed194af13383940.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17191","senseId":"1","lemma":"씻다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"있으니까","meaning":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","explanation":"있다：正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）；으니까：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62595","senseId":"2","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"조금만","meaning":"片刻，一会儿","explanation":"조금：片刻，一会儿；만：表示“只、仅”。","readings":[{"term":"조금","audio":"/audio/b4049b7414b62d9bee5d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61176","senseId":"2","lemma":"조금","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"기다려.","meaning":"等，等待","explanation":"기다리다：等，等待；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"기다리다","audio":"/audio/1f9765247406d52d5aaa.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62264","senseId":"1","lemma":"기다리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"d39087dda3899d88","term":"그래","zh":"好吧，是","audio":"/audio/d39087dda3899d88b99b.mp3","entryId":"27656","definition":"用于回答，表示“会那样做，是那样的，知道了”等肯定的含义。","pronunciation":["그래"]},{"id":"df159f47a890ff65","term":"지금","zh":"现在","audio":"/audio/df159f47a890ff655039.mp3","entryId":"62522","definition":"指正在说话的此时。","pronunciation":["지금"]},{"id":"409668b14ff6c36e","term":"쌀","zh":"米，大米","audio":"/audio/409668b14ff6c36e6073.mp3","entryId":"62094","definition":"做饭吃的，稻谷脱壳后的仁儿。","pronunciation":["쌀"]},{"id":"1fc19ed194af1338","term":"씻다","zh":"洗，刷","audio":"/audio/1fc19ed194af13383940.mp3","entryId":"17191","definition":"除去污垢或脏的东西而使之干净。","pronunciation":["씯따"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"62595","definition":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","pronunciation":["읻따"]},{"id":"b4049b7414b62d9b","term":"조금","zh":"片刻，一会儿","audio":"/audio/b4049b7414b62d9bee5d.mp3","entryId":"61176","definition":"短暂时间。","pronunciation":["조금"]},{"id":"1f9765247406d52d","term":"기다리다","zh":"等，等待","audio":"/audio/1f9765247406d52d5aaa.mp3","entryId":"62264","definition":"直到人、时机到来或某事完成为止，一直打发时间。","pronunciation":["기다리다"]}],"audio":"/audio/f15399f00f05399fce30.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.248,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=62094","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"초급","day":39,"sequenceScore":1.8456,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["好的，我正在洗米，你稍等一会儿。","妈妈，我饿了。请给我一些饭吧。","智秀好像连这个世界是怎么运转的都不太明白呢。"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["妈妈，我饿了。请给我一些饭吧。","智秀好像连这个世界是怎么运转的都不太明白呢。","好的，我正在洗米，你稍等一会儿。"],"answer":2}]}
